{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》首站由 KC 與波波帶路來到銅鑼灣創意海鮮酒家「明廚」。第一道推介的是「藤椒蔥油蟶子皇」（$228），大廚將肥美巨型蟶子皇與杏鮑菇切成同等薄片，同樣爽口，再配合燒香的二荊條青椒、綠蔥油及鮮麻花椒油，入口酸辣開胃，完美襯托出蟶子的濃郁甘甜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二道「招牌火焰斷片海蝦」（$368）將新鮮海蝦浸泡頂級花雕酒10分鐘，再配炸香的乾蔥、蒜子與薑片在砂鍋生焗，剝殼食蝦肉爽彈甜美，連殼咬更是焦香爆汁！最後登場的「蘇西醬雞油蒸白金雕」（$298）嚴選油脂豐盈的金目鯛去骨，配上以紫蘇葉、西洋菜葉、雞油及魚露打製的「蘇西醬」大火蒸熟，草本清香結合香濃雞油，鮮美惹味。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">明廚</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：銅鑼灣堅拿道西15號永德大廈地下G8-11號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"97cbf52a-d379-43a7-88f1-aa2a1d14297e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026xMZDwzEieR1786590862.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"97cbf52a-d379-43a7-88f1-aa2a1d14297e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2134d6a0-0433-4c8b-9e5b-ec8f02f46564.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026mRzEf9QctQ1786590862.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2134d6a0-0433-4c8b-9e5b-ec8f02f46564.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5fddcf7a-941e-4ae0-b53c-9cde7d5d7edb.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Py9ZZGzLMt1786590861.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5fddcf7a-941e-4ae0-b53c-9cde7d5d7edb.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨後由施焯日與陳若思帶大家到北角街坊至愛潮汕菜館「聚潮潮汕地道美食」。招牌「豬雜湯」用豬面頰兩邊近下巴的腮骨（鮑魚骨）精心熬製，湯底清甜帶胡椒香。碗裡的豬肚爽口、豬潤粉嫩、豬心微甜無腥味，各部位獨立處理，口感極佳。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另一道「潮式煎蠔烙」外皮煎至金黃酥脆，賣相宛如傳統意式 Pizza，店家選用每日新鮮珍珠蠔配濃郁鴨蛋打勻落鑊，撒上自製海南胡椒粉，香口無比。而「欖菜蒸馬友」則精選每日到貨、1斤3兩重油脂最完美的馬友魚，配上鹹香欖菜蒸熟，魚肉嫩滑、入口即化。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">聚潮潮汕地道美食</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：北角和富道84-94號銀輝大廈地下4號舖</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0dc9ef26-3bd5-40a0-a947-157bc5af97bf.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026rIkZZmwUdW1786590861.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0dc9ef26-3bd5-40a0-a947-157bc5af97bf.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"59b116e8-2db6-4210-ba0a-2eeaf0491259.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026H1XnqUBbQi1786590861.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"59b116e8-2db6-4210-ba0a-2eeaf0491259.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bcbb74ea-ebce-40d2-bc8b-5253f8c0f617.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026cYvIx2vOEb1786590862.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bcbb74ea-ebce-40d2-bc8b-5253f8c0f617.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e4afc367-e8ee-4321-9e37-3e6a90fa25f1.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026XI7RUg82uf1786590862.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e4afc367-e8ee-4321-9e37-3e6a90fa25f1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">節目尾段，黃嘉雯與蔡景行來到太子懷舊快餐店「利口福快餐店」。二人率先品嚐「即叫即炒沙爹牛肉西多士」，香脆西多士裹著甜辣香濃的即炒沙爹牛肉，風味獨特。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">之後一道「芝士流心豬扒包」更是極度邪惡，夾在漢堡包中間的生炸豬扒足足有手指公一般厚，外脆內嫩。一切為二時，金黃濃郁的芝士流心不停湧出，肉汁與熔岩芝士在口中交融，奶香飽滿。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">利口福快餐店</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：太子大埔道14-16號華都大廈地下1號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f8d8577c-06c4-4920-92e0-cb2fd9e06e72.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Bex9EekvGh1786590862.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f8d8577c-06c4-4920-92e0-cb2fd9e06e72.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2c1c7717-956f-4c3a-a573-89236ea7a962.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026tSzyxd60sc1786590862.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2c1c7717-956f-4c3a-a573-89236ea7a962.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T13:19:06.665743+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":768,"images":9,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}